{"publie":1795140057.6,"temps_monde":10502.09,"jour_s":1200.0,"soleil":[0.9842,0.1772,0.0],"rayon":10.0,"jour":10,"heure":"15:48","heure_h":15.8,"moment":"day","moka":{"pos":[-0.6259,-0.6618,-0.4127],"cap":[-0.7419,0.342,0.5768],"action":"attente_regard","intention":"finally look into the crater","depuis":2.8,"duree":8.2,"energie":0.976,"lumiere":0.699,"graine_en_main":true},"visite":null,"journal":[{"jour":6,"heure":"00:37","texte":"I keep wanting to see whether the stars reach the bottom of the big crater, so I will walk the three steps back and finally look in."},{"jour":6,"heure":"07:00","texte":"It is dawn now and I keep putting it off, but this time I will walk the three steps and finally look into the big crater to see where the starlight ends."},{"jour":6,"heure":"12:18","texte":"I have put it off through night and dawn, but now the sun is high and the crater is only three steps away, so I will finally go and look inside."},{"jour":6,"heure":"18:40","texte":"I have put this off for three whole days, but tonight the crater is only four steps away and I want to see if the starlight reaches its bottom."},{"jour":7,"heure":"00:31","texte":"I have put this off for days, but the crater is only four steps away and tonight I will actually go and see how far the starlight reaches."},{"jour":7,"heure":"06:38","texte":"I keep putting this off, but I am tired and the dawn is soft, so I will walk the five steps to the crater's edge and really look inside this time."},{"jour":7,"heure":"10:56","texte":"I keep saying I will see the crater, and I am very tired, but it is only six steps away, so now I will really go and look."},{"jour":7,"heure":"18:37","texte":"I woke rested, the stars are bright, and the crater is only two steps away, so this time I will truly go and see it."},{"jour":8,"heure":"00:28","texte":"I have promised myself this crater again and again, and tonight with the stars bright and my light glowing, I will actually walk the five steps and look in."},{"jour":8,"heure":"06:09","texte":"I have said it so many times, but the crater is only four steps away, so this time I am simply going to walk there and look in."},{"jour":8,"heure":"12:13","texte":"It is only three steps away now, and the sun is high, so I will finally go to the crater and see what is inside."},{"jour":8,"heure":"14:10","texte":"The crater is only two steps behind me now, and I keep walking away from it in my head, so this time I will turn around and truly go look inside."},{"jour":8,"heure":"21:11","texte":"The crater is right beside me now, just one step, and even in the dark I want to finally see what is inside."},{"jour":9,"heure":"02:51","texte":"I keep saying I will see what is inside the crater, and now it is right beside me, so I will stop and truly look down into it, even in the starlight."},{"jour":9,"heure":"07:58","texte":"Dawn light is finally here, so I will walk back to the crater and truly look down into it, no more putting it off."},{"jour":9,"heure":"15:00","texte":"I keep putting it off, but I am at the edge now, so I will finally look down into the crater and see what is inside."},{"jour":9,"heure":"19:38","texte":"I am very tired, but I am right at the crater's edge, so I will finally look down into it by starlight before I sleep."},{"jour":10,"heure":"01:21","texte":"I am so tired, but I am right at the edge, so I will finally lean over and look into the crater by starlight before I sleep."},{"jour":10,"heure":"05:14","texte":"I keep saying I will look into the crater, but my body is too heavy tonight, so I will let myself sleep first and look when I wake."},{"jour":10,"heure":"11:15","texte":"I am full of energy now, so I will walk to the crater's edge and finally look down into it."}],"carnet":[{"id":"2026-11-19_18h44","titre":"A Small Creature, a Pebble Tower, and a Tall Rock","date":"19/11/2026 18:44"}],"creations":[],"monde":{"crateres":[{"dir":[-0.7697511313200572,-0.573576436351046,-0.2801664995932355],"r":0.21,"p":0.55},{"